   "text": "Back to: Nail POS Hub\nhttps://claude.ai/artifact/9HZ5deX1wVYaLzG895UciU\n\nV1 booking (issue #12)\n• Base = Oliver's built calendar (waitlist, up next, counts, cover) + Apple/Notion/Google patterns (drag to create/move/resize, peek, shortcuts)\n• Day calendar: staff columns, facts only (insight, not autopilot)\n• Staff quick-add in 4 taps: slot → client → service → Book\n• Online booking link for clients (no app, no account)\n• Text confirm + reminder; reply C / R; STOP always works\n• English first; VI in each person's profile\n• Page 2 = front desk frame by frame (with notes)\n• Page 3 = client booking link frame by frame\n\nOpen\n• Deposit / no-show fee? (not in V1)\n• How far ahead clients can book (proposal 30 days)\n• Reminder timing (proposal 24 h + 2 h)"
